# hypernix.torch_compat API reference

Implementation: `src/hypernix/system/torch_compat.py`

## `is_legacy_torch() -> bool`

True for torch < 2.0 (the \"old Intel Mac / torch 1.13\" path).

## `has_native_rmsnorm() -> bool`

True for torch ≥ 2.4 where ``torch.nn.RMSNorm`` is available.

## `scaled_dot_product_attention(q, k, v, attn_mask=None, dropout_p=0.0, is_causal=False) -> torch.Tensor`

Portable attention. On torch ≥ 2.0 dispatches to the native

## `describe() -> dict[str, object]`

Return a one-shot summary of the active torch compat state.
